The bug was on line 7: URL comparison used strict equality (`===`), which is case-sensitive. URLs differing only in hostname casing (e.g., `https://example.com/a` vs `https://EXAMPLE.com/a`) were treated as different bookmarks.

**Fix:** Changed the comparison to `b.url.toLowerCase() === inc.url.toLowerCase()`, making URL matching case-insensitive.


